  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Implement quoted identifier parsing by @zherczeg in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2715\r\n* feat(demo): Run js in worker in wat2wasm demo by @spotandjake in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2568\r\n* Refactor browser demos and Emscripten build output by @kevmoo in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2721\r\n* Fix wasm2wat demo by @kevmoo in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2722\r\n* Cleanup how emscripten is invoked by @kevmoo in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2723\r\n* [demo] Use arrow functions by @kevmoo in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2725\r\n* Fix Emscripten warnings by removing deprecated writeAsciiToMemory by @kevmoo in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2724\r\n* [wasm2c] Fix exception testing on macOS by @kevmoo in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2716\r\n* bug fix for wat2wasm demo to remove call to module.resolveNames by @yuvraj-sahu in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2726\r\n* [wast-parser] Optimize Consume() by @zherczeg in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2727\r\n* Move filename out of Location by @zherczeg in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2728\r\n* Add declaration limit checks to parser by @zherczeg in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2736\r\n* [lexer] Simplify GetLineOffsets by @zherczeg in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2735\r\n* Remove debug-parser option and other unused variables by @zherczeg in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2739\r\n* Use unsigned line info in Locations by @zherczeg in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2738\r\n* Validator: thread table limits through `OnReturnCallIndirect` by @ggreif in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2744\r\n* Include error information on error opening output file by @sbc100 in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2745\r\n* Bump version to 1.0.41 by @sbc100 in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2746\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @spotandjake made their first contribution in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2568\r\n* @kevmoo made their first contribution in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2721\r\n* @yuvraj-sahu made their first contribution in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2726\r\n* @ggreif made their first contribution in https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/pull/2744\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/compare/1.0.40...1.0.41",
